<html><body><h1></h1><br><br><h2></h2>
TrancheChain is an interactive, browser-based blockchain simulator designed to demonstrate how funds (tranches) can be securely disbursed and verified using decentralized concepts. It provides a visual, step-by-step breakdown of how cryptographic hashes, digital signatures, and immutable ledgers work together to create a zero-trust, tamper-evident financial system.<br><br><h2></h2><br><br>#<h2></h2>
The Dashboard provides a real-time overview of the network's health and financial status. It tracks:
